      "name": "Hydraulic Deflection",
      "text": "⬻ (abjuration, water); Drawing moisture from the surrounding atmosphere, the azarketi explorer creates a disc of hovering water that deflects incoming attacks. They gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of their next turn."
    },
    {
      "name": "Surface Skimmer",
      "text": "While the azarketi explorer is submerged just below the water's surface, they have cover from attacks made by creatures out of the water."
